OMNeT++ Experiment 22
Title: Mobility and Handover in a Multi-Cell 5G/LTE Network

Description:
Simulates a moving UE across three cells; handover is triggered when the target cell signal exceeds serving signal by a threshold.

Project source files:
- Experiment_22.ned  (NED network and simple module)
- Experiment_22.cc   (C++ simulation module)
- omnetpp.ini           (simulation configuration)

Run in an installed OMNeT++ project:
  opp_makemake
  make
  ./Experiment22Network -u Cmdenv -f omnetpp.ini

NOTE: Graph and console images in this folder are prepared demonstration artifacts.
Run this project in OMNeT++ to obtain environment-specific simulation logs and vectors.
